"r3" value="&amp;lt;&amp;lt;Include&amp;gt;&amp;gt;" style="endArrow=open;endSize=12;dashed=1;html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=12;" parent="1" source="u_conf" target="u_res" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r4" value="&amp;lt;&amp;lt;Extend&amp;gt;&amp;gt;" style="endArrow=open;endSize=12;dashed=1;html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=12;" parent="1" source="u_rech" target="u_res" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="trace" value="&lt;b&gt;Trazabilidad&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CDU de origen:&lt;/b&gt; CDU-01 Realizar Compra Omnicanal (CUN-01). Amplía «Gestionar Carrito» de Realizar Compra&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Drivers:&lt;/b&gt; RF 01, RF 04 · RC 03, RC 08&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Modelo de datos:&lt;/b&gt; orders.cart (índice único one_active_cart_per_customer), orders.cart_item, orders.purchase_order, orders.order_item, inventory.reservation, inventory.stock (check reserved ≤ on_hand)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Despliegue:&lt;/b&gt; Order / Checkout Service e Inventory Service → contenedor sgologic-backend (paquetes orders, inventory)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Código:&lt;/b&gt; POST /api/customers/{id}/cart/items · PUT y DELETE /api/customers/{id}/cart/items/{productId} · GET /api/customers/{id}/cart · POST /api/orders/checkout — CartService, CartItemController, CheckoutService, InventoryReservationService&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Evidencia:&lt;/b&gt; FASE 2/pruebas/prueba_reserva_concurrente.py y prueba_flujo_volumen.py (3 canales)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1FAEE;strokeColor=#457B9D;fontColor=#1D3557;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;arcSize=4;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="672" width="1060" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>